# Sales, Product & What-If Analysis Dashboard (Power BI)

An interactive multi-page **Power BI** report analyzing sales, quantities, orders, profit, sub-category performance, and What-If scenarios across `2014`–`2017`, featuring custom navigation, a decomposition breakdown, and a report tooltip page.

